    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awu, wawunjengomfowethu owancela amabele kamama! uma bengikuthola ungaphandle, bengizokwanga; yebo, akumelwe ngidelelwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bengiyakukuhola, ngikungenise endlini kamame, abeyakungifundisa; bengiyakunathisa izinongo zompomegranati wami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isandla sakhe sokhohlo kumelwe sibe ngaphansi kwekhanda lami, nesandla sakhe sokunene siyongigona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyanifungisa, madodakazi aseJerusalema, ukuba ningaluvusi uthando lwami, ningaluvusi uthando lwami, lungakamthandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngubani okhuphuka ehlane futhi encike kusithandwa sakhe? Ngakuphakamisa phansi kwesihlahla sama-apula; lapho unyoko wakuzalela khona; khona wakuzalela owakuthwala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngibeke njengophawu enhliziyweni yakho, njengophawu engalweni yakho, ngokuba uthando lunamandla njengokufa; Umhawu unonya njengeHayidesi: amalahle awo angamalahle omlilo alangabi elinamandla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amanzi amaningi awanakulucima uthando, nemifudlana ayinakuludla;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silodadewethu omncane, njalo kalawo amabele; kumele senzenjani nosisi wethu mhla kukhulunywa ngaye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma elugange, siyakwakha isigodlo sesiliva phezu kwalo; futhi uma kuwumnyango, sizowubiyela ngamapulangwe omsedari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mina ngiludonga, amabele ami anjengemibhoshongo; ngase nginjengomngane othandekayo emehlweni akhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wayenesivini eBali Hamoni; isivini wasinika ababonisi; kwaba yilowo nalowo ngokwezithelo zawo ukuletha amashekeli ayinkulungwane esiliva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isivini sami, esingesami, siphambi kwami; wena, Solomon, uyakuba nenkulungwane, nabalinda izithelo zakhona amakhulu amabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena ohlala emasimini, abangane bayalilalela ilizwi lakho; ake ngizwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
